Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）可恶 我不会输的 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）哼 你能赢我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开让开！让开 让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请让一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛～啊 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）九十九游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不就是WDC的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马君吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.17,0:00:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 我 可是游马君的大粉丝呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对 现在可不是高兴的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去要迟到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会让您迟到的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座城市的宝物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗冠军的游马君迟到什么的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是不会允许的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边 这边。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边 这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边 这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}锵锵—— 让各位久等了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本校之宝 九十九游马同学{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我把他带来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游…游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 抱歉忘了自我介绍。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从今天起转学来到这个班级的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月零。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位 请多多指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起那个你们两个都迟到了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 都怪那个转校生我可倒了大霉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊？ 那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么关系嘛 她是游马的粉丝哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟人家好好相处啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请给我签名！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（片桐）大家冷静一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁 谁啊？ 那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（片桐）来吧 享受决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}职业决斗者片桐大辅啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}职业决斗者？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要开特别课程了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说是能跟片桐职业选手决斗呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真、真的假的？那也太厉害了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！职业决斗者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肯定很强吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）职业决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这真是相当有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉格）九十九游马 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么对付你呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么玩意儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想问你点事。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秋）发动魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家真好啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也想玩啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也没办法吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（片桐）还挺有两下子的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了。我用弁庆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.21,0:05:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你们所有人直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（弁庆）看招～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么好叹气的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，享受决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好意思今天的决斗到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}享受决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然职业决斗者就是厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然在那个回合就分出了胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.85,0:05:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，我也想和片桐职业决斗一场啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）我明白了，游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请交给我吧，和片桐职业的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:05:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我真月一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？喂等一下，真月！真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼，果然决斗就是好啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉格）哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿！不好意思，这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能给我签个名吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇怪啊他应该还没回去才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}片桐职业选手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请等一下 片桐职业选手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实 我有件事想拜托您。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我自作主张地觉得这样对他好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望您能和一位名叫九十九游马的学生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行一场决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.63,0:06:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鳥{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）真月君！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}铁{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}男）真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多行了吧 回去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！ 真月君一定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:06:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才在找片桐职业选手的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我又没求你这么做！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个声音是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}告诉我九十九游马在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能说！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你说是为我好我也绝对不会说！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就别怪我把你打趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招！直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完 热血指导～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 真月！真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 对不起我 明明是想为你好的……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月……你这混蛋 对真月做了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就是九十九游马吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不肯说出你下落的愚蠢家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不过是给了他一点热血指导
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 我要用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安的力量将你埋葬！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管你是巴利安还是什么统统给你砸个稀巴烂！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进展顺利。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样 No.卡就是我的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了。我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 混沌超量的力量还远远是个未知数。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先看看对手怎么出招……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 三张卡召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌中有3张等级4以下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级的怪兽卡时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从其中特殊召唤1只。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤 等级3的莱莱德！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 莱莱德！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要召唤 唰唰骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（唰唰骑士）唰——！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 当我的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有等级3的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能特殊召唤这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 宝箱怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（宝箱怪）宝箱怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级3的怪兽3只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.34！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电算机兽 太字节！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太字节啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从第1回合就进行 No.召唤啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.07,0:09:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顽抗巴利安那胡闹的根性{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血指导！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:09:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动　场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修行王国　训练世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张场地魔法的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌中的怪兽卡２张　送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把手牌中等级７以上的怪兽１只
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用解放直接召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　热血兽王　熊人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级８！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且当我的场上有熊人在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡　熊之靴营地！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组中将等级４的兽战士族怪兽１只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　热血兽士　狼吠！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！　发动狼吠的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１回合一次可以从墓地特殊召唤这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　狼吠！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}转眼间就召唤出了3只怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还早着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血指导现在才要开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动熊人的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的等级4以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兽战士族怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到回合结束时变成2倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狼吠它们的等级从4变成8！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用等级8的熊人和2只狼吠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.09,0:11:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，热血指导王 巨人教练！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动巨人教练的热血效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须洗切卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后双方抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是怪兽卡的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级低的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:11:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到８００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是等级８！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是等级１。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧，８００的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.13,0:12:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还早着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再次使用叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将双方的卡组洗牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是等级８的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是等级３。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就接招吧，８００的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，用掉最后的叠放素材
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}互相洗切卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽是等级4。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，把你的卡亮出来看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡是等级6！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负这才刚刚开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难得我这么热血的指导。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来得把这份热血{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深深烙印在你这家伙的肉体上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，要来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己的怪兽超量升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用巨人教练
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:13:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诞生于混沌之中的 异晶界之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对污秽的世界现在正是降下裁决之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 混沌超量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血指导神 究极教练！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.14,0:14:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 发动异晶界之力的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方1只超量怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.37,0:14:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部夺取 吸收！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌吸取！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 究极教练的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌叠放单元就有4个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的热血指导要开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 究极教练！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把太字节击溃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太字节！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还早着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动终极猎手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个混沌叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 如果那张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.67,0:15:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是等级4以下的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就受到那张卡攻击力数值的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.39,0:15:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要用4个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把所有混沌叠放单位都用上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极试炼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要抽的卡是4张！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！被自己的怪兽埋葬吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！抽到的是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查查弓手 等级3！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3！？那就承受那个攻击力吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽到的卡会送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，再抽一次卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.07,0:16:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！我怎么可能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡，神奇魔杖！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，还能再抽两次！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽到的是等级4……影蜥蜴。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，剩下的生命值只有100了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，做最后一次抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）请住手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:16:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.09,0:17:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我什么都愿意做！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以游马君{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请放过游马君吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！你在说什么啊，真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是美丽的友情过家家啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但说到底，那家伙不过是个丧家犬罢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.09,0:17:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙才不是什么丧家犬！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他只是为了别人，觉得那样做是好的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不顾一切地拼命往前冲而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊透顶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！为了你，我也一定要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽到的是等级3，咚咚天狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！结束了！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.39,0:17:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确，这家伙是等级3的怪兽，但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}0！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力0！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 泥田坊 送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后这家伙被送去墓地的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以把场上的1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}返回手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那家伙的怪兽吹飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极蕾娜的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 不会受到怪兽效果影响！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来最后的挣扎也是徒劳啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是徒劳。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}埋葬混乱·巴利·恐慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 被送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方每有1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给对手玩家给予１００点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且　按照那个伤害数值
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降低１只怪兽的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.39,0:18:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的怪兽卡有　１８张！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此　给予玩家和　你的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１８００的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　再从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法　我我我×我我我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择我的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１只我我我怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽变成相同的卡特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用　等级４的我我我魔术师２只
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（希望皇霍普）霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然召唤出了 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 希望皇霍普作为超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.51,0:20:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动霍普雷的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷的攻击力提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.14,0:20:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊 好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击终极训练者！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑·混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶　九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.87,0:21:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次　我一定要把你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？　这里是…　我做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.87,0:21:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？　你不记得了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然　他也被操控了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马同学　你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来　去保健室吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.41,0:21:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你我们才能赢　谢了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月　从今天起你就是我们的同伴了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的　我是为了你们好！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下　真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的　“为了你们好”真是够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.04,0:23:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.79,0:23:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.62,0:24:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感谢你的应募我会把它当作我的卡来用的。

